&lt;p&gt;Mike Nolan, KFI traffic reporter and contributor to the KFI Handel morning show was involved in a plane crash.  Nolan is a former Marine, and excellent radio personality.  I listen to this show quite a bit while I am doing my artwork.  I decided to send a get well image to cheer him up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.ktla.com/news/landing/ktla-corona-plane-crash-july-2012,0,4849863.story"&gt;MIKE’S CRASH&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="http://www.kfiam640.com/pages/Handel2.html"&gt;FEATURED ON KFI WEB BLOG (kinda cool)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
